      "notes": [
        "GFDL-ESM4 `tos` is already `gr`, regridded from its tripolar grid to 1° with `conserve_order1`; bilinear interpolation to 1° does not restore native resolution, and its land-sea mask is the regridded one.",
        "Resolution differs (CESM2 ~100 km, MPI-ESM1-2-LR ~250 km); features narrower than the coarse grid are not comparable in amplitude, which qualifies model amplitude comparisons."
